    <p class="city-panel-text">Send goods between your places when you'd rather not drive them yourself. Couriers charge a fee and take a few minutes.</p>
    <div class="market" data-couriers></div>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="apartments">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">08</span> The Apartments</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Staff</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">Degens looking for work. Hire one for your stall, a shop, a garden or the Workshop: they work while you're away too, and keep a share of what they handle.</p>
    <div class="market" data-staff></div>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="karts">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">09</span> The kart park</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Go-karts</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">The Sector 7 Circuit north of the ring highway in the north-east, off Kart Road with its own metro stop: twelve corners, two banked sweepers, a hill with a tunnel and a jump, a hairpin and a flyover, raced both ways round. Pure racing against seven rivals in three classes from Street to Neon: drift for boosts, keep it off the grass, and some races run at night or in the rain. Three cups run as a series of four races with points by place and a trophy for the podium; single races and time trials (against the par ghost) any time, and a new challenge every day. Watch from the covered grandstand, the grass banks or the hut's roof terrace. Karts are bought and tuned at the hut for Dorras earned in the city.</p>
    <button type="button" class="chip-link kart-walkin" data-kart-walkin>Walk in</button>
    {/* Your best laps, trophies and race counts (index.ts fills it with kartRecordsHtml() from kart-records.ts) */}
    <div class="kart-panel-records" data-kart-panel-records></div>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="airport">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">10</span> Sector 7 Airport</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Fly it yourself</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">Out past the ring highway on the city's south edge: a long runway, the terminal with its eight gates and its departures deck, the tower, the maintenance hangar and the fire station, the cargo shed with its freighters and truck yard, and the DEGEN AIR jets on their timetable. Your own aircraft waits in Hangar 1, by the general aviation gate: pick a prop plane, a small jet or a helicopter at the office and paint it, then take off from the apron or the runway and fly anywhere over the city. It levels itself, can't stall and bumps softly off everything; touch down anywhere and climb out. Free to fly, and only for the city.</p>
    <button type="button" class="chip-link kart-walkin" data-air-walkin>Walk in</button>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="fightclub">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">11</span> The south bank</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Fight Club</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">A boxing gym on the south bank: a ring under a shed roof, bags, bleachers and the trainer's counter. Fight hand to hand in the ring: spar with the gym's own fighters for as long as you like, or take one on in a bout of three rounds, first to two. Bouts pay a prize and XP, in Dorras earned in the city, never real money. New fighting styles come to the trainer later.</p>
    <button type="button" class="chip-link fight-walkin" data-fight-walkin>Walk in</button>
    {/* Your record: wins, losses, knock-outs, best chain and each opponent (index.ts fills it with fightRecordHtml() from fight-ui.ts) */}
    <div class="fight-panel-record" data-fight-panel-record></div>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="liberty">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">12</span> The river</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Liberty Bridge</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">Sector 7's footbridge, one of a kind. Two sandstone gate towers stand in the river with the Liberty flame spiralling up from their roofs, and the approaches climb from the promenades, hung from pale blue chains. Across the middle the deck lifts in two halves when the tall ship sails through. Take the lift in either tower up to the high walkways and walk all the way round, with the river far below. It's for people only.</p>
    <button type="button" class="chip-link kart-walkin" data-liberty-walkin>Walk in</button>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="harbour">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">12</span> The river</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Harbour Bridge</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">Sector 7's suspension bridge, where the east avenue and the metro cross the river. Two stone towers stand in the water with great pointed arches, the cables swing over their tops from anchorages on the promenades, and a web of stays fans out from each. The deck rises over the middle so the boats pass under: two lanes each way, the metro on its raised level down the middle, and a footway along each edge through the towers' smaller arches, lanterns and a necklace of lights along the cables at night.</p>
    <button type="button" class="chip-link kart-walkin" data-harbour-walkin>Walk in</button>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="trenches">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">13</span> The Trenches</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">The Block</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">The courtyard at the heart of the Trench Houses, south of the river. Brick towers all round, a fenced court with a game always on, a playground, the handball wall, the community garden and string lights over it all at night. The metro stops right outside, and four corner shops round about are for sale at the Vault (from level 5). The story starts here: coming soon.</p>
    <button type="button" class="chip-link kart-walkin" data-block-walkin>Walk in</button>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="club">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">14</span> The Trenches</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Club PULSE</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">The riverside's landmark: a black hall behind neon fins that throb with the beat, PULSE across them, the tall sign on its corner pylon and a heartbeat traced in neon over the roof. Up top, the sky deck looks out over the river, and searchlights sweep the sky at night. Down at the door, a queue waits along the velvet rope by the red carpet. The doors open later: coming soon.</p>
