    <p class="city-panel-text">Trench Arms, on the corner by Harbor Stores, facing the boardwalk and the river. Step up to the hatch on the street: it's the Armoury's counter and workbench, the same guns and mods. The ones your score unlocks are free; the rest cost Dorras earned in the city.</p>
