  <template data-panel-tpl="pier">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">17</span> The waterfront</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Pier 7</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">The Trenches' waterfront: a timber boardwalk out over the river from the highway to the town's promenade, with sodium lamps, benches facing the water and the old dock crane by the Refinery. Pier 7 runs out under its lit arch to a head with the bait and coffee kiosk, binoculars and people fishing off the rail. At its head stands the Pier House, its clock tower keeping your time. Behind the boardwalk is the riverside: The Wharf, the Refinery, Harbor Stores and Club PULSE.</p>
    <button type="button" class="chip-link kart-walkin" data-pier-walkin>Walk in</button>
  </template>
  <template data-panel-tpl="nightmarket">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">17</span> The waterfront</p>
