  <template data-panel-tpl="mall">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">20</span> North of downtown</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">Starlight Mall</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">The city's shopping mall, between the north and east avenues past the Parkway. A glass and white-clad hall under a glass vault, with two department stores at its ends, Maxwell's and Bright & Co., and its totem by the road. Inside, two floors of shops round an atrium with a fountain under a ring of light, escalators and a glass lift up to the food court, kiosks, kiddie rides and a photo booth. Out front there's the loop road, the car park with its taxi rank and bus stop, and a multi-storey car park. The shops open later: coming soon.</p>
    <button type="button" class="chip-link kart-walkin" data-mall-walkin>Walk in</button>
