  <template data-panel-tpl="hotel">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">21</span> Crestmont</p>
    <h2 id="city-panel-title" class="city-panel-title">The Coralline</h2>
    <p class="city-panel-text">Crestmont's grand hotel, off the boulevard on the Flats: four pink storeys round a tower with its name in script on the roof, a porte-cochère over the door, a drive round a fountain under date palms, and a pool garden behind with striped cabanas. Rooms and the pool open later: coming soon.</p>
